user_template:
Analyze the following batch of {record_count} animal health records from a {production_type} farm sync session.

Farm ID: {farm_id}
Sync Session: {sync_session_id}
Synced At: {synced_at}

Health Records:
{records_block}

Return a JSON object with a results array. Each element must correspond to one record in the same order, with fields: record_id (same Record ID above), severity (low/medium/high/critical), summary (one sentence clinical assessment), contagion_risk (boolean), immediate_action_required (boolean).
